# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CLIENT DATA — NEVER COMMIT
#
# Samples/ and test_fixtures/ hold real Circana client read results (Instacart,
# L'Oreal, Bounty, Stella Artois, Planters and others). The test fixtures are
# derived from those files and carry real data rows too.
#
# The predecessor project (new_pg_antara_6_24) had to retroactively strip client
# .xlsx/.csv files out of git history. This blocklist exists so that does not
# happen again. Do not add exceptions for individual data files.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
Samples/
test_fixtures/

# Outlook message exports (may contain client correspondence)
*.msg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.Python
venv/
.venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Streamlit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
~$*
*.tmp
